Reports unresolved SQL references. Example (MySQL): 'CREATE TABLE users(id INT, name VARCHAR(40));
CREATE TABLE admins(id INT, col1 INT);

SELECT users.id, admins.id FROM admins WHERE admins.id > 1;' The 'users.id' column is unresolved because the 'users' table is missing in the FROM clause.

